get.description:
Returns all available voices grouped hierarchically by **language > dialect/accent > gender**.

The response also includes a `clone` key with the authenticated user's cloned voices.

**Query parameters** (all optional):
- `language` — Filter by language name (e.g. `english`, `german`)
- `accent` — Filter by dialect/accent (e.g. `United States`, `United Kingdom`)
- `gender` — Filter by gender (`male`, `female`, `male-child`, `female-child`, `neutral`)
- `tag` — Filter by voice tag or name

**Response structure:**
```json
{
  "data": {
    "english": {
      "United States": {
        "male": [{ "name": "...", "voice_id": "...", ... }],
        "female": [...]
      }
    },
    "clone": {
      "My Voice": { "name": "...", "voice_id": "...", ... }
    }
  }
}
```
